Insular (https://gitlab.com/secure-system/Insular), a fork of Island (https://github.com/oasisfeng/island)
Copyright (C) Oasis Feng and the Insular contributors. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Adapted (rewritten in this project's own code, following the original approach):
  - the manual (ADB) Vault setup steps: pm create-user --managed, pm install-existing, dpm set-profile-owner,
    am start-user (core/common ShellCommands.kt, app diag/Runner.kt check V2), and the first-start receiver
    (admin/Admin.kt UserInitReceiver, after ManualProvisioningReceiver);
  - the profile-owner receiver and post-setup steps (admin/Admin.kt, after IslandDeviceAdminReceiver and
    IslandProvisioning);
  - the "Shuttle": persistable cross-profile URI grants to the app's own provider, handed over by a cross-profile
    activity start (channel/Channel.kt, after ShuttleProvider and ShuttleCarrierActivity);
  - cloning by an installer session fed with the app's own APK files (clone/Clone.kt, after AppInstallerActivity);
  - app-ops set by the profile owner for apps in its profile (admin/Admin.kt OwnerAppOps, after AppOpsHelper);
  - File Shuttle's use of the system picker's Work tab (bridge A).

